    {
      "factor": "Regulatory exposure",
      "permissioned": "KYC/AML, accredited-investor checks, and jurisdictional restrictions can be enforced at the contract or pool level, which helps with securities and lending licenses.",
      "open": "Permissionless access makes compliance harder to enforce on-chain. You may need front-end geofencing, wrapper entities, or off-chain legal structures."
    },
    {
      "factor": "Credit risk model",
      "permissioned": "Off-chain underwriting, legal recourse, and known counterparties let you lend against cash flows or invoices rather than overcollateralized crypto.",
