    },
    {
      "factor": "Control and upgradeability",
      "permissioned": "Admins can pause, freeze, or restructure facilities, which is useful for workouts and defaults.",
      "open": "Immutable or governance-controlled contracts reduce counterparty trust but limit intervention during a credit event."
    },
    {
      "factor": "Time to market and audit scope",
